{"title":"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Sal_Khan\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Sal Khan</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Product\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Product\">product</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> of three <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Positive_integer\" title=\"Positive integer\">positive integers</a> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times their <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sum\" title=\"Sum\">sum</a>, and one of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">integers</a> is the sum of the other two. Find the sum of all possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the three integers be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acc6d9a6172d35127b6cb37ea92192caf7029a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" />.  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/c/07c55ffe476352b513fbb6721eecdc6513a69c18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = abc = 6(a + b + c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"182\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/1/fe1cdc1e46873ba2ac448fb547e5af2c278b0286.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/6/f06cb16d98d194bed1cd5ad1e38732510d2009eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = ab(a + b) = 6(a + b + a + b) = 12(a + b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"356\" height=\"18\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are positive, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/a/74a2c3b6d08936f1ea5a17dfd597817c221dccff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/c/bac9a10dd068d99753bfce956841aecf0af0c83a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{a, b\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> is one of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/a/a5a90b5b285bcf2eac1be2e2aa68616bd44a606d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1, 12\\}, \\{2, 6\\}, \\{3, 4\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"160\" height=\"20\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/f/5df6a591474ffd81edd37d8d9f52f6f476caa531.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> is one of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/e/18ec9bf57733059cd798973a01f5b4275e54a10e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13, 8, 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"16\" /> so the sum of all possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/f/b1fd37a7a4af465e7e46302b4e6e4c4bd2cf7ba8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 \\cdot (13 + 8 + 7) = 12(28) = \\boxed{336}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"266\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Sal_Khan\">Video Solution by Sal Khan</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Sal Khan\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JPQ8cfOsYxo&amp;list=PLSQl0a2vh4HCtW1EiNlfW_YoNAA38D0l4&amp;index=7\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JPQ8cfOsYxo&amp;list=PLSQl0a2vh4HCtW1EiNlfW_YoNAA38D0l4&amp;index=7</a>\n- AMBRIGGS\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II\" title=\"2003 AIME II\">2003 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2003 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2003\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2003 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2